=== Separate databases
site_a -> database site_a
site_b -> database site_b
A config change on site_a is not visible on site_b

=== Content is per site: an article created on site_a is served only by site_a
site_a content types: article,page
site_b content types: article,page
site-a.localhost/node/1 -> 200
site-b.localhost/node/1 -> 404

=== Config sync directory is outside public files
site_a config_sync_directory=../config/site_a/sync
site_b config_sync_directory=../config/site_b/sync

=== HTTP routing by hostname (nginx -> PHP-FPM)
site-a.localhost -> 200 Home | Demo site_a
site-b.localhost -> 200 Welcome! | Demo site_b
unknown.example.net/ -> 404
unknown.example.net/core/install.php -> 404

=== nginx hardening
/healthz -> 200 (want 200)
/.htaccess -> 403 (want 403)
/core/core.services.yml -> 403 (want 403)
/sites/site_a/settings.php -> 404 (want 404)
/core/lib/Drupal.php -> 404 (want 404)
/sites/site_a/private/x.txt -> 403 (want 403)

