/sites/site_a/files/css/css_6fsVNPKtC0BSaIovjY2tu0zwJlhILnGRpIJACr1UYMM.css -> 200

=== Private files directory
site_a private:// -> /mnt/private/site_a writable
site_b private:// -> /mnt/private/site_b writable

